WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.900
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:14.920 --> 00:16.800
- What about Phat? - That boy?

10
00:17.062 --> 00:18.063
I'll take care of him myself.

11
00:18.166 --> 00:20.890
If you find Hattha and her family, kill them all.

12
00:20.901 --> 00:22.760
- Muk?- - Master Tim wants to talk to you two.

13
00:22.960 --> 00:24.000
Especially Hattha.

14
00:24.272 --> 00:25.280
Those bruises on your neck...

15
00:25.366 --> 00:26.367
Master Tim did that to you, didn't he?

16
00:26.470 --> 00:27.800
Get in the car!

17
00:27.900 --> 00:30.080
- Hey. - If you don't run now, I won't be able to help you anymore.

18
00:30.090 --> 00:31.091
Thank you.

19
00:31.790 --> 00:32.840
You did all this

20
00:33.160 --> 00:34.840
just because I was that little girl?

21
00:35.043 --> 00:37.440
You were the last bit of happiness in my life.

22
00:37.928 --> 00:39.729
It's too late for me to turn my life around.

23
00:39.784 --> 00:41.200
But you can still stop now.

24
00:41.214 --> 00:42.560
Stop looking for that flatfooted bastard.

25
00:42.776 --> 00:44.600
And go back to living your life with your dad.

26
00:46.000 --> 00:48.301
Thank you for letting me know.

27
00:48.450 --> 00:50.240
Let's go.

28
00:50.347 --> 00:51.440
He did the right thing.

29
00:51.800 --> 00:52.801
Wan.

30
00:53.406 --> 00:54.640
- What? - That's Mr. Krit.

31
00:54.899 --> 00:56.400
I know who can help us.

32
00:57.000 --> 00:58.472
Hey! Wait.

33
01:08.534 --> 01:09.920
Flatfoot insoles?

34
01:10.203 --> 01:11.440
Mr. Krit uses these too?

35
02:11.691 --> 02:13.640
- Beat the shit out of him. - Yes, boss.

36
02:13.766 --> 02:14.767
Hey, let's do this!

37
02:15.568 --> 02:18.040
Hey! Get my shoe.

38
02:21.510 --> 02:22.511
Let's go!

39
02:33.952 --> 02:35.040
Mr. Krit has flat feet.

40
02:41.440 --> 02:42.441
[Master Tim sent a photo.]

41
03:05.451 --> 03:06.452
Why did you take my dad?

42
03:06.939 --> 03:09.240
I sent someone to bring you here nicely. Why didn't you come?

43
03:10.360 --> 03:11.361
What do you want?

44
03:12.758 --> 03:14.600
Your father's deadly massage manual.

45
03:16.070 --> 03:17.071
In exchange for his life.

46
03:20.459 --> 03:22.120
How are my dad and Uncle Korn doing?

47
03:22.400 --> 03:23.501
Let me talk to them.

48
03:24.083 --> 03:25.240
You're really worried about them, huh?

49
03:26.088 --> 03:27.880
Then you'd better hurry up and get here.

50
03:29.406 --> 03:31.250
I'm not a patient man, you know.

51
03:37.875 --> 03:39.080
The deadly massage manual?

52
03:41.107 --> 03:42.712
But Uncle Korn already burned the notebook.

53
03:43.070 --> 03:44.480
He said it was unreadable, too.

54
03:45.931 --> 03:47.200
Then what are you going to give Master Tim?

55
03:47.494 --> 03:48.880
I'll have to use that manual.

56
03:49.678 --> 03:52.040
I kept it in a bag I was taking to the house in Photharam.

57
03:53.126 --> 03:54.127
Then let's go.

58
03:59.984 --> 04:01.040
Wan, you'll have to go alone.

59
04:04.310 --> 04:06.240
- Why? - I have something to take care of.

60
04:07.622 --> 04:09.707
Wait, what else do you have to do?

61
04:10.811 --> 04:12.054
I saw Mr. Krit attacking Phat.

62
04:13.928 --> 04:14.929
Be careful.

63
04:16.702 --> 04:17.703
Keep me posted.

64
04:48.096 --> 04:50.000
Phat! Phat!

65
04:52.120 --> 04:53.521
Get up! Get up!

66
04:55.472 --> 04:56.473
One, two.

67
04:59.483 --> 05:00.484
What's wrong? Can't breathe?

68
05:01.974 --> 05:03.000
Come here.

69
05:03.014 --> 05:04.027
Got the wind knocked out of you? Come here.

70
05:09.000 --> 05:10.560
Phat, lift your head. Lift it up.

71
05:11.363 --> 05:12.480
Slowly lower it.

72
05:12.702 --> 05:13.960
Slowly lower it.

73
05:14.000 --> 05:15.001
Okay.

74
05:16.867 --> 05:17.868
Lift your head.

75
05:19.176 --> 05:20.177
Lift your head.

76
05:20.531 --> 05:22.520
Okay, now slowly lower it.

77
05:25.128 --> 05:26.129
Lift your head.

78
05:27.656 --> 05:28.657
Slowly lower it.

79
05:33.582 --> 05:34.583
Lift your head.

80
05:38.278 --> 05:39.279
Slowly lower it.

81
05:46.560 --> 05:47.561
Phat.

82
05:47.947 --> 05:49.320
Can you get up? Let's get you to the hospital. Come on.

83
05:50.771 --> 05:51.772
No.

84
05:51.810 --> 05:52.811
I'm not going to the hospital.

85
05:53.640 --> 05:54.741
Take me to my room.

86
05:59.790 --> 06:01.240
Phat, wait.

87
06:02.248 --> 06:03.320
Come here.

88
06:26.454 --> 06:28.480
Why did Mr. Krit attack you?

89
06:35.504 --> 06:38.440
He's Dongyang's business partner.

90
06:44.747 --> 06:46.779
Is there anyone who actually cares about this country?

91
06:53.792 --> 06:55.360
Then why didn't he kill you?

92
07:02.875 --> 07:03.876
I don't know.

93
07:06.280 --> 07:08.136
Maybe because I'm still useful to him.

94
07:13.686 --> 07:16.270
Get some rest. I'll go get you some medicine.

95
07:25.835 --> 07:26.836
Go lie down.

96
07:57.779 --> 07:58.810
Stop it, Minkheng.

97
08:00.486 --> 08:01.720
They brought us all the way here.

98
08:02.363 --> 08:03.764
They're not going to let us go that easily.

99
08:18.523 --> 08:19.840
You haven't changed a bit, In.

100
08:21.430 --> 08:22.800
But you've changed a lot.

101
08:26.168 --> 08:27.200
Just wait a little longer.

102
08:30.078 --> 08:31.160
Your daughter will be here soon.

103
08:32.152 --> 08:33.360
What are you going to do to my daughter?

104
08:34.030 --> 08:36.640
Just make her bring me the deadly massage manual.

105
08:38.702 --> 08:40.400
The deadly massage manual?

106
08:41.834 --> 08:44.960
I asked you to help me find a way.

107
08:47.150 --> 08:48.720
But when you found it,

108
08:50.264 --> 08:51.865
you kept it all to yourself.

109
08:52.403 --> 08:55.120
Fine, I admit I lied to you.

110
08:56.136 --> 08:57.840
Because I didn't want a technique like this

111
08:58.303 --> 09:00.280
to fall into the hands of someone like you.

112
09:02.040 --> 09:04.041
What's wrong with someone like me?

113
09:05.691 --> 09:06.920
What's so bad about me?

114
09:11.969 --> 09:12.970
Tell me!

115
09:14.171 --> 09:15.880
I've already burned that manual.

116
09:17.467 --> 09:18.760
It was unreadable anyway.

117
09:20.176 --> 09:21.500
Even if you've burned it,

118
09:23.403 --> 09:25.704
you still have to teach me how to do it.

119
09:28.235 --> 09:30.000
Until I can kill someone with massage.

120
09:31.216 --> 09:32.217
Understand?

121
09:36.512 --> 09:38.610
Tim, it's been so many years.

122
09:39.019 --> 09:41.460
- Are you still obsessed with it? - Shut your mouth!

123
09:42.020 --> 09:44.280
And you! You helped him keep it from me.

124
09:44.507 --> 09:45.680
You even helped him go into hiding.

125
09:46.300 --> 09:47.680
If you weren't my brother,

126
09:47.710 --> 09:49.381
I would've dealt with you and your son long ago.

127
09:57.998 --> 09:59.000
Now that's more like

128
10:00.622 --> 10:02.952
the same old asshole brother I know.

129
10:11.923 --> 10:12.924
Let go of me!

130
10:19.256 --> 10:20.257
Stop it right now!

131
10:20.808 --> 10:22.700
I'll do whatever you want! Just stop!

132
10:23.347 --> 10:24.348
Stop!

133
10:30.507 --> 10:31.920
- Muk! - Yes?

134
10:32.102 --> 10:33.103
Keep an eye on them.

135
10:34.502 --> 10:36.120
Don't screw up like last time.

136
10:40.600 --> 10:41.601
How are you, Inn?

137
10:42.147 --> 10:43.148
I'm okay.

138
10:46.827 --> 10:48.120
This deadly massage technique...

139
10:49.238 --> 10:50.360
Does it really work?

140
11:14.579 --> 11:17.000
Hello, Muk. This is Wan.

141
11:17.219 --> 11:18.520
I got your number from Ya.

142
11:19.288 --> 11:21.400
Master Tim has kidnapped my dad,

143
11:21.566 --> 11:23.440
Uncle Korn, and Minkheng.

144
11:23.646 --> 11:25.582
Have you seen them? Are they okay?

145
11:26.584 --> 11:29.080
Yes, everyone's still safe.

146
11:31.752 --> 11:33.155
If you want them all to survive,

147
11:33.635 --> 11:35.512
you need to bring Master Tim the deadly massage manual.

148
11:36.227 --> 11:37.240
That's all I can say.

149
12:25.080 --> 12:26.081
[Do Not Read]

150
12:37.782 --> 12:40.720
At least we know Master Tim won't hurt Dad and the others.

151
12:41.646 --> 12:43.379
So what's your plan?

152
12:44.216 --> 12:46.600
Why did you ask me to get this unreadable manual?

153
12:47.198 --> 12:49.000
We still need the original manual as proof.

154
12:49.611 --> 12:50.612
But I've memorized the whole thing.

155
12:51.387 --> 12:52.742
I'm writing a new one.

156
12:54.326 --> 12:55.584
Then we'll go see Master Tim together.

157
12:58.342 --> 12:59.760
How's Phat doing?

158
13:00.862 --> 13:02.307
He tried to kill Dongyang, but he's still alive.

159
13:02.750 --> 13:04.751
I think you should be careful around him.

160
13:07.214 --> 13:08.215
I am keeping an eye on him.

161
13:09.520 --> 13:10.521
I want to know the truth, too.

162
13:12.700 --> 13:13.880
Something feels off to me.

163
13:14.646 --> 13:16.000
None of it adds up.

164
13:16.294 --> 13:18.040
He's Dongyang's bodyguard,

165
13:18.763 --> 13:20.440
but he's risked his life to save you several times.

166
13:22.700 --> 13:25.430
And after doing something that serious, he's still alive.

167
13:30.110 --> 13:31.111
Mom?

168
13:33.600 --> 13:34.901
- No! - Wan, I have to go.

169
13:36.312 --> 13:37.313
Don't leave me.

170
13:42.328 --> 13:43.329
Phat?

171
13:47.774 --> 13:48.840
- Mom! - Phat!

172
13:49.320 --> 13:50.321
Don't leave me.

173
13:50.408 --> 13:51.409
Phat.

174
13:52.920 --> 13:53.921
Mom.

175
15:59.440 --> 16:01.441
[Flatfoot]

176
17:00.526 --> 17:01.527
Feeling better already?

177
17:02.440 --> 17:03.441
A little better.

178
17:03.779 --> 17:05.100
So I went out to get some food.

179
17:13.088 --> 17:14.400
Then why did you buy a plant?

180
17:15.766 --> 17:17.100
I'm going to plant it in the garden.

181
17:19.400 --> 17:20.401
Come with me.

182
17:28.056 --> 17:29.640
How did I end up sleeping in bed?

183
17:33.328 --> 17:35.846
Maybe you sleepwalked there.

184
17:37.329 --> 17:38.330
I was asleep.

185
17:41.475 --> 17:42.476
Want some?

186
17:42.958 --> 17:44.160
I'll go take a shower first.

187
18:00.182 --> 18:01.600
Oh, Uncle!

188
18:02.220 --> 18:03.700
- Hello, Phat. - Hello.

189
18:03.811 --> 18:05.840
Here, I brought you some snacks.

190
18:06.339 --> 18:07.720
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

191
18:07.907 --> 18:09.600
There was a storm the other day.

192
18:09.822 --> 18:12.200
It knocked down a bunch of our trees.

193
18:12.568 --> 18:14.120
I've got everything ready.

194
18:14.302 --> 18:16.302
I'll stop by and take a look after work.

195
18:16.526 --> 18:18.000
It's okay. I'll take care of it myself.

196
18:18.211 --> 18:19.960
- Thank you. See you later. - See ya.

197
18:20.062 --> 18:21.063
Enjoy the snacks.

198
18:41.486 --> 18:42.560
Why do you plant trees?

199
18:49.971 --> 18:51.120
Every tree I plant

200
18:53.800 --> 18:55.160
represents a life.

201
19:02.283 --> 19:03.480
That was the first one.

202
19:05.240 --> 19:07.100
The day I completed my first job,

203
19:09.926 --> 19:11.327
I came home and couldn't sleep.

204
19:12.624 --> 19:15.080
My uncle scolded me. He said if I wanted to do this for a living,

205
19:15.100 --> 19:16.200
I'd have to learn to live with it.

206
19:37.427 --> 19:38.760
So that's why you started planting trees?

207
19:39.752 --> 19:41.240
I know it can't make up for what I've done.

208
19:43.384 --> 19:45.960
But at least it makes me feel like I'm making amends somehow.

209
20:01.643 --> 20:03.044
What was your first time like?

210
20:09.779 --> 20:11.144
What happened to me doesn't matter.

211
20:13.838 --> 20:15.600
But I don't want you to end up like me.

212
20:18.656 --> 20:20.200
Stop looking for Flatfoot.

213
20:22.331 --> 20:24.000
Are you worried about me or someone else?

214
20:28.512 --> 20:30.203
And the day Mr. Krit attacked you,

215
20:30.950 --> 20:32.320
what did he say to you?

216
20:34.934 --> 20:37.200
He was furious that I killed Dongyang.

217
20:47.515 --> 20:48.720
Was all of this because of me?

218
20:55.702 --> 20:56.703
Phat.

219
20:59.568 --> 21:01.440
I'm sorry. I won't cause you any more trouble.

220
21:03.078 --> 21:04.280
What are you planning to do now?

221
21:34.555 --> 21:36.880
From now on, Master Tim and I

222
21:37.312 --> 21:40.330
will be taking over Arokaya Land from Dongyang.

223
21:41.536 --> 21:42.537
Don't worry.

224
21:43.675 --> 21:45.080
Even though Dongyang is gone,

225
21:45.499 --> 21:47.240
all our deals will remain unchanged.

226
21:47.910 --> 21:49.734
There's still no progress in Dongyang's case.

227
21:50.400 --> 21:52.112
And you're making an announcement like this?

228
21:54.150 --> 21:56.051
I can't help but think

229
21:58.246 --> 21:59.720
Phat was just a bodyguard.

230
22:00.544 --> 22:03.160
He wouldn't have dared do it unless someone ordered him to.

231
22:05.291 --> 22:06.960
Nobody ordered him to do anything.

232
22:07.686 --> 22:10.280
The autopsy report confirmed it was an accident.

233
22:10.736 --> 22:12.240
Dongyang fell down the stairs.

234
22:13.040 --> 22:14.541
So that's how you want to play it?

235
22:17.880 --> 22:20.000
Actually, I think this is a good thing.

236
22:20.467 --> 22:22.446
Because we finally get to meet face-to-face.

237
22:22.856 --> 22:25.304
No more dealing through a nominee like Dongyang.

238
22:26.104 --> 22:28.320
Now we can make decisions directly.

239
22:28.579 --> 22:30.920
Why worry about someone who's already dead?

240
22:32.131 --> 22:34.760
Wouldn't it be better to work together on our next project?

241
22:35.800 --> 22:37.840
Shouldn't we focus on what we stand to gain?

242
22:38.256 --> 22:40.925
Is that why you got rid of Brother Yang?

243
22:41.552 --> 22:44.614
You and Master Tim are trying to take over his business, aren't you?

244
23:02.523 --> 23:04.379
I've been more than generous.

245
23:05.958 --> 23:06.959
Now,

246
23:08.214 --> 23:09.215
what's it going to be?

247
23:18.904 --> 23:19.905
Deal.

248
23:21.512 --> 23:22.513
That's more like it.

249
23:24.627 --> 23:26.320
There are so many reporters here.

250
23:26.590 --> 23:27.760
Hey, here he comes!

251
23:28.950 --> 23:31.680
- Sir, could we have an interview? - Could we ask you a few questions?

252
23:31.952 --> 23:33.131
Could we have an interview, please?

253
23:33.232 --> 23:34.280
Could we interview you, sir?

254
23:35.254 --> 23:37.400
There were earlier reports that Dongyang was ill.

255
23:37.480 --> 23:39.301
So how did he suddenly pass away?

256
23:40.120 --> 23:41.160
It was an accident.

257
23:42.040 --> 23:44.400
Dongyang fell down the stairs at his place.

258
23:45.041 --> 23:46.642
We were just as shocked by the news.

259
23:46.835 --> 23:49.400
Will this affect the Arokaya project?

260
23:50.000 --> 23:51.001
No, it won't.

261
23:51.310 --> 23:53.360
The project will continue as planned.

262
23:54.158 --> 23:57.759
Master Tim will take over from Dongyang.

263
23:58.792 --> 24:00.078
But there's no need to worry.

264
24:00.920 --> 24:02.590
Even though we're both Thai,

265
24:02.872 --> 24:06.280
I'll be conducting even stricter inspections.

266
24:06.704 --> 24:10.520
So I'd like to apologize to Master Tim in advance.

267
24:11.400 --> 24:13.440
Of course. No problem at all.

268
24:13.803 --> 24:15.560
And my commitment

269
24:16.280 --> 24:20.120
to promoting Thai massage as a form of soft power

270
24:20.568 --> 24:22.611
and making it famous around the world, as I've often said,

271
24:23.155 --> 24:24.156
you remember that, right?

272
24:24.800 --> 24:26.801
If you'll excuse me, I have a meeting to attend.

273
24:27.880 --> 24:29.600
Could we ask you a few more questions?

274
24:32.912 --> 24:34.440
- Hello. - Can I book a Thai massage session?

275
24:34.678 --> 24:36.360
- I'd like Muk as my massage therapist. - Of course.

276
24:46.000 --> 24:47.001
Muk.

277
24:47.320 --> 24:49.250
- You do realize… - The usual Thai massage, right?

278
24:55.320 --> 24:56.321
Yes.

279
25:07.339 --> 25:08.340
Muk.

280
25:08.640 --> 25:10.672
Do you realize how risky this is?

281
25:11.483 --> 25:14.619
If you get caught, you're finished.

282
25:15.174 --> 25:16.880
I'm really worried about my dad.

283
25:17.656 --> 25:19.400
- Can you take me to him? - I can't.

284
25:20.400 --> 25:21.401
Come on.

285
25:26.400 --> 25:28.760
Master Tim is holding your dad and the others on the VIP floor.

286
25:30.331 --> 25:31.974
That place is crawling with his men.

287
25:35.456 --> 25:37.030
At least let me talk to them.

288
25:40.142 --> 25:41.143
Please.

289
25:50.920 --> 25:51.939
Your scent...

290
25:53.048 --> 25:54.360
tells me you're worried about me.

291
26:24.344 --> 26:25.345
Keep watch at the door.

292
26:30.900 --> 26:31.920
How are Korn and the others doing?

293
26:32.867 --> 26:33.868
They're fine, sir.

294
26:34.627 --> 26:35.960
No signs of trying to escape.

295
26:38.760 --> 26:41.161
They're with a woman and a disabled man. How could they escape?

296
26:44.176 --> 26:46.347
But their kids are probably looking for a way to rescue them.

297
26:48.326 --> 26:49.327
Keep a close eye on them.

298
26:50.832 --> 26:52.600
Don't let anyone get near them.

299
26:54.171 --> 26:55.360
Only Muk has access to them right now, sir.

300
26:56.480 --> 26:57.481
Where's she now?

301
26:58.139 --> 26:59.600
One of her regular clients just came in.

302
27:00.123 --> 27:01.600
Muk is giving a client a massage, sir.

303
27:10.224 --> 27:11.680
- Go to the VIP floor. - Yes, sir.

304
27:16.150 --> 27:17.254
I'm in the room now.

305
27:21.120 --> 27:22.880
Dad! Dad, it's me.

306
27:23.691 --> 27:24.960
Has Master Tim hurt any of you?

307
27:26.091 --> 27:27.092
No, he hasn't.

308
27:27.160 --> 27:28.161
How are you doing?

309
27:28.700 --> 27:31.080
They're safe. They're with Phat right now.

310
27:31.900 --> 27:32.901
Phat?

311
27:34.134 --> 27:35.600
The bodyguard who killed Dongyang?

312
27:45.275 --> 27:47.750
Wan, tell them not to trust him.

313
27:48.224 --> 27:49.800
He was Dongyang's bodyguard, after all.

314
27:50.134 --> 27:51.135
There's definitely more to him than meets the eye.

315
27:56.835 --> 27:59.336
Wan, what about the manual?

316
28:00.019 --> 28:01.020
What did she say?

317
28:01.542 --> 28:03.960
She's writing a new one. It should be almost finished.

318
28:09.440 --> 28:11.040
I have to go now. I need to hang up.

319
28:26.990 --> 28:28.491
Press here. Press on my neck.

320
28:28.627 --> 28:29.920
Muk is in the room, Master Tim.

321
28:39.435 --> 28:40.720
Korn!

322
28:41.470 --> 28:42.471
Korn!

323
28:42.926 --> 28:44.320
- Master Tim! - Korn!

324
28:45.742 --> 28:47.200
He suddenly started having a seizure, Master Tim!

325
28:48.200 --> 28:50.401
This happens when he doesn't take his medication.

326
28:50.926 --> 28:52.160
Do something.

327
28:52.787 --> 28:53.788
Hurry!

328
29:39.366 --> 29:41.600
I thought you were taking care of a regular client.

329
29:44.507 --> 29:45.560
What are you doing here?

330
29:45.840 --> 29:48.200
The client had something urgent to attend to, so he left early.

331
29:49.030 --> 29:50.440
So I came up here to check on things.

332
30:01.832 --> 30:03.300
Don't you dare die on me yet.

333
30:31.200 --> 30:32.201
Thank you.

334
30:34.492 --> 30:36.400
[Dead]

335
30:40.318 --> 30:41.646
Master Tim has kidnapped my dad.

336
30:43.656 --> 30:44.657
What does he want?

337
30:47.478 --> 30:48.747
This deadly massage manual.

338
30:52.300 --> 30:53.360
Deadly massage?

339
30:55.848 --> 30:57.520
Like what you did to Dongyang?

340
30:59.582 --> 31:00.583
Yeah.

341
31:11.880 --> 31:13.520
How can you be sure it works?

342
31:16.528 --> 31:19.307
Have you ever tried it on anyone besides Dongyang?

343
31:21.056 --> 31:22.057
No, I haven't.

344
31:24.027 --> 31:25.040
Dongyang was the first.

345
31:33.968 --> 31:34.969
Want to try it?

346
31:37.190 --> 31:39.080
I'm curious to see what it's like, too.

347
31:45.457 --> 31:46.880
But it could kill you.

348
31:49.798 --> 31:50.799
I trust you.

349
31:52.678 --> 31:54.720
I believe you won't let me die.

350
32:19.219 --> 32:21.475
Most people think Hattha's techniques

351
32:22.558 --> 32:23.880
are meant to save lives

352
32:25.696 --> 32:26.800
or to heal people.

353
32:28.500 --> 32:32.301
But the truth is, any organ that can be healed

354
32:34.422 --> 32:35.880
can also be destroyed.

355
32:38.464 --> 32:41.200
Firing a gun requires a precise trigger finger.

356
32:42.544 --> 32:43.640
But with deadly massage,

357
32:46.747 --> 32:48.100
if you want a quick death,

358
32:51.000 --> 32:52.201
your fingers must be gentle.

359
32:53.701 --> 32:54.702
Soft.

360
32:58.030 --> 32:59.280
A gun leaves behind shell casings.

361
33:02.115 --> 33:03.500
But hands leave no trace.

362
33:23.115 --> 33:24.116
The guiding point.

363
33:34.240 --> 33:35.241
How does it feel?

364
33:37.600 --> 33:38.601
Relaxing.

365
33:50.483 --> 33:51.484
The surrounding point.

366
33:58.838 --> 33:59.839
How does it feel?

367
34:02.918 --> 34:03.920
Nothing unusual.

368
34:06.000 --> 34:07.050
Try raising your arm.

369
34:11.208 --> 34:12.360
It feels weak.

370
34:22.792 --> 34:23.793
The fatal point.

371
34:26.830 --> 34:27.840
Are you sure?

372
34:59.896 --> 35:00.897
One...

373
35:01.600 --> 35:02.601
Two...

374
35:03.160 --> 35:04.161
Three...

375
35:05.022 --> 35:06.023
Four...

376
35:06.915 --> 35:07.916
Five...

377
