Six...

378
35:10.854 --> 35:11.855
Seven...

379
35:12.843 --> 35:13.844
Eight...

380
35:14.600 --> 35:15.601
Phat, how do you feel?

381
35:16.891 --> 35:17.892
Relaxed.

382
35:20.496 --> 35:21.497
I feel sleepy.

383
35:23.014 --> 35:24.015
15...

384
35:24.950 --> 35:25.951
16...

385
35:27.067 --> 35:28.068
17...

386
35:29.160 --> 35:30.161
18...

387
35:31.198 --> 35:32.280
19...

388
35:33.523 --> 35:34.524
20...

389
35:35.763 --> 35:36.764
21...

390
35:38.171 --> 35:39.172
22...

391
35:40.379 --> 35:41.380
23...

392
35:42.683 --> 35:43.684
24...

393
35:46.016 --> 35:47.017
ภัทร

394
35:47.888 --> 35:48.889
26...

395
35:50.035 --> 35:51.036
27...

396
35:51.992 --> 35:53.000
28...

397
35:54.000 --> 35:55.160
29...

398
35:56.254 --> 35:57.255
30...

399
35:58.680 --> 35:59.681
31...

400
36:04.200 --> 36:05.680
Phat! Phat!

401
36:06.179 --> 36:07.600
Phat, wake up! Phat!

402
36:07.854 --> 36:08.855
Phat!

403
36:10.760 --> 36:11.761
Phat!

404
36:12.075 --> 36:13.920
Phat, wake up! Hurry! Phat!

405
36:16.475 --> 36:17.560
Wake up, Phat!

406
36:22.614 --> 36:23.615
Phat!

407
36:25.926 --> 36:27.047
Phat, wake up!

408
36:45.896 --> 36:47.534
Wake up, Phat!

409
37:19.182 --> 37:21.120
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. Does it hurt?

410
37:22.920 --> 37:25.200
I couldn't keep pressing for the full cycle. I was afraid you'd die.

411
37:46.046 --> 37:47.400
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

412
37:47.454 --> 37:48.455
I'm sorry.

413
37:53.016 --> 37:54.080
Were you worried about me?

414
37:58.638 --> 37:59.770
Of course I was worried about you.

415
38:08.200 --> 38:09.201
I'm so sorry.

416
39:42.160 --> 39:43.291
Are you gonna tell me or not

417
39:44.574 --> 39:46.374
why you went to see Korn and the others?

418
39:48.096 --> 39:50.480
I went there because you told me to, Master Tim.

419
39:50.859 --> 39:53.040
Because I told you to, huh?

420
39:53.806 --> 39:55.307
Because I told you to?

421
40:10.334 --> 40:11.440
You've deleted it already, haven't you?

422
40:13.230 --> 40:14.231
Who was it?

423
40:14.926 --> 40:17.360
There really was no one, Master Tim.

424
40:25.080 --> 40:26.881
I picked you up from a pile of garbage.

425
40:28.281 --> 40:29.840
If you want to go back to being trash,

426
40:32.029 --> 40:33.160
I'll make damn sure you do.

427
40:34.139 --> 40:35.140
Master Tim...

428
40:36.128 --> 40:37.880
I would never betray you.

429
40:38.683 --> 40:41.080
It was that bitch Hattha, wasn't it? She's planning to rescue them.

430
40:41.744 --> 40:42.745
Huh?

431
40:43.070 --> 40:44.171
It was that bitch Hattha, wasn't it?

432
40:56.542 --> 40:57.680
What are you doing, Master Tim?

433
40:58.766 --> 41:00.640
Sending her a little greeting.

434
41:01.955 --> 41:04.560
I'm not going to make life that easy for her.

435
41:10.038 --> 41:11.080
Soon enough,

436
41:13.755 --> 41:15.720
I'll master the deadly massage technique.

437
41:21.184 --> 41:24.600
Everyone's life will be in my hands.

438
42:18.475 --> 42:19.476
Are you hungry yet?

439
42:20.464 --> 42:21.465
Want something to eat?

440
42:44.300 --> 42:45.960
How are you going to save your dad?

441
42:50.880 --> 42:53.560
I'll use the rewritten massage manual to negotiate with Master Tim.

442
42:57.102 --> 42:58.103
But before I go,

443
42:58.883 --> 43:01.480
I want to know if Mr. Krit is Flatfoot, the man who killed my mother.

444
43:05.720 --> 43:07.840
I know you don't want me obsessing over this.

445
43:11.000 --> 43:12.880
But it's been haunting me for years.

446
43:21.411 --> 43:22.412
I understand.

447
43:25.838 --> 43:26.839
I'll go with you.

448
43:30.718 --> 43:31.719
Thank you.

449
43:36.470 --> 43:37.471
Have a seat.

450
43:47.232 --> 43:48.233
Go ahead and eat.

451
43:48.837 --> 43:49.838
I'm going to take a shower.

452
44:29.550 --> 44:33.240
Are you sure Phat is helping you out of the goodness of his heart?

453
44:34.088 --> 44:36.880
Think about why he killed Dongyang

454
44:36.976 --> 44:38.120
and is still alive...

455
44:39.270 --> 44:40.440
Master Tim.

456
45:00.688 --> 45:02.689
Why did Mr. Krit attack you?

457
45:03.776 --> 45:05.400
Then why didn't he kill you?

458
46:27.331 --> 46:28.640
What do you mean?

459
46:29.700 --> 46:30.701
We...

460
46:31.315 --> 46:32.560
We can't arrest him, sweetheart.

461
46:37.651 --> 46:39.261
Police Colonel

462
46:40.350 --> 46:42.648
Krit Teeranasakul.

463
46:52.723 --> 46:53.724
Flat feet?

464
46:57.742 --> 46:59.880
Hey, let me go! Damn it!

465
47:06.043 --> 47:07.844
Flatfoot insoles?

466
47:13.051 --> 47:14.352
Mr. Krit has flat feet?

467
47:45.432 --> 47:46.433
Hattha.

468
47:50.875 --> 47:51.876
Hattha.

469
48:17.320 --> 48:19.321
[Teeranasakul Residence]

470
48:25.528 --> 48:26.600
Please wait here.

471
48:50.086 --> 48:51.087
Oh.

472
48:51.531 --> 48:53.840
That's a photo of my wife and my son.

473
49:01.651 --> 49:03.100
- Hello, sir. - Hello, dear.

474
49:06.040 --> 49:07.200
They're lovely.

475
49:08.275 --> 49:10.632
They're living abroad now.

476
49:11.219 --> 49:13.640
Anyway, you've come all the way to my house today.

477
49:14.376 --> 49:15.920
How can I help you?

478
49:16.088 --> 49:18.240
Why don't we talk in the living room?

479
49:18.995 --> 49:19.996
Come on in.

480
49:35.635 --> 49:37.864
I'm sorry to bother you at home, sir.

481
49:44.123 --> 49:46.560
My father, Uncle Doctor In, and my caregiver

482
49:46.610 --> 49:48.614
have been kidnapped by Master Tim and taken to Arokaya.

483
49:49.851 --> 49:52.060
Since you're overseeing the place, I thought you could help me.

484
49:54.640 --> 49:55.641
Wait a minute.

485
49:57.000 --> 49:59.720
Your father...

486
50:00.091 --> 50:02.760
Didn't he pass away back then?

487
50:04.059 --> 50:06.230
I'm sorry I lied to you last time, sir.

488
50:07.160 --> 50:08.640
My father wanted to stay in hiding.

489
50:11.558 --> 50:14.480
If the people who destroyed our family found out he was still alive,

490
50:14.500 --> 50:16.100
they'd come after him to silence him for good.

491
50:23.094 --> 50:25.920
What does any of this have to do with Master Tim?

492
50:27.643 --> 50:29.200
Why would he kidnap your father?

493
50:31.296 --> 50:33.240
Master Tim thinks I killed Dongyang.

494
50:34.272 --> 50:36.560
But I actually witnessed a bodyguard

495
50:36.848 --> 50:38.120
killing Dongyang.

496
50:45.915 --> 50:47.280
Please help me, sir.

497
50:47.904 --> 50:49.840
I'm just an ordinary person.

498
50:49.905 --> 50:51.680
I don't have the power to fight someone like him.

499
50:52.726 --> 50:55.600
I think Master Tim knows the people who attacked my family in Phuket.

500
50:57.214 --> 50:59.859
Please help me, sir. I have no one else to turn to.

501
51:01.886 --> 51:03.880
So that's it?

502
51:04.430 --> 51:06.640
This is all about Dongyang, right?

503
51:06.728 --> 51:10.480
Or is there something else involving Master Tim?

504
51:11.667 --> 51:14.080
I'm not sure what Master Tim really wants, either.

505
51:24.040 --> 51:25.960
And do you still have

506
51:26.488 --> 51:28.056
any evidence from that case?

507
51:28.254 --> 51:29.255
Yes, I do.

508
51:31.710 --> 51:33.422
That's great, then.

509
51:33.672 --> 51:35.400
Let's go right away.

510
51:35.473 --> 51:36.820
So we can get this whole thing sorted out.

511
51:38.392 --> 51:39.592
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

512
51:39.683 --> 51:41.684
- It's okay, dear. Don't worry. - It's all wet!

513
51:41.800 --> 51:43.100
- It's okay. - I'm so sorry.

514
51:43.160 --> 51:44.579
- I'll have the housekeeper clean it up. - No, I can do it.

515
51:45.134 --> 51:48.000
- Don't worry. I'll have the housekeeper take care of it. - It's okay.

516
51:48.135 --> 51:50.440
- I can clean it. - No, it's fine.

517
51:54.950 --> 51:56.120
You're Flatfoot!

518
52:04.907 --> 52:05.960
You're Flatfoot!

519
52:14.750 --> 52:15.751
You're Flatfoot!

520
52:18.606 --> 52:19.640
You killed my mother!

521
52:41.792 --> 52:42.880
You killed my mother!

522
53:02.168 --> 53:03.360
Hey! What are you doing?

523
53:13.416 --> 53:14.317
Stop!

524
53:14.360 --> 53:15.400
You little brat!

525
53:16.219 --> 53:18.240
I've been waiting for you to finally figure it out.

526
53:29.435 --> 53:30.600
Can't keep your cool anymore, huh?

527
53:43.307 --> 53:44.308
You...

528
53:55.726 --> 53:57.440
You worthless parasites

529
53:57.872 --> 54:00.720
have been getting in the way of my business for far too long.

530
54:16.003 --> 54:17.004
Dad!

531
54:21.536 --> 54:22.537
Don't!

532
54:38.288 --> 54:40.600
If I get the deadly massage manual from Korn,

533
54:41.104 --> 54:44.520
I can help you eliminate your political rivals.

534
54:45.200 --> 54:47.720
I won't let a damn thing stand in my way.

535
54:50.987 --> 54:51.988
They're here.

536
54:57.254 --> 54:58.840
I just don't want you to make the same mistake again, Dad.

537
55:00.966 --> 55:02.440
If you're gonna shoot me, then do it.

538
55:03.302 --> 55:04.360
Go ahead. Shoot me.
